{"title":"Career Roadmap: MIS Executive","role":"MIS Executive","summary":"An MIS Executive manages business data and converts operational information into structured reports, dashboards and management insights.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA - Business Analytics"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in business reporting, Excel, data management, dashboards, SQL, Power BI and decision-support analytics"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An MIS Executive manages business data and converts operational information into structured reports, dashboards and management insights."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collecting business data"},{"text":"Maintaining databases and spreadsheets"},{"text":"Preparing daily/weekly/monthly MIS reports"},{"text":"Data cleaning and validation"},{"text":"Dashboard creation"},{"text":"KPI tracking"},{"text":"Automated reporting"},{"text":"Business performance analysis"},{"text":"Coordination with different departments"},{"text":"Management reporting"},{"text":"Identifying data inconsistencies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA Business Analytics graduate, the ideal progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Knowledge","Excel","SQL","Power BI","Data Management","Business Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"MIS is also a strong entry point into Data Analytics, Business Intelligence, Reporting Analytics, Sales Operations, Finance Analytics and Business Analysis."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business & data fundamentals"},{"text":"Management, accounting, statistics, Excel"},{"text":"Business reporting exercise"},{"text":"Weak Excel fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Reporting & database skills"},{"text":"Advanced Excel, SQL, data cleaning"},{"text":"MIS reporting system"},{"text":"Manual-only reporting"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"BI & automation"},{"text":"Power BI, Power Query, data modelling"},{"text":"Interactive business dashboard"},{"text":"Poor analytical thinking"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"Advanced analytics + internship"},{"text":"SQL, BI, automation, business analysis"},{"text":"MIS capstone + internship"},{"text":"No real business dataset experience"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Business Mathematics"},{"text":"Introduction to Excel"},{"text":"Basic computer applications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Marketing Fundamentals"},{"text":"Organizational Behaviour"},{"text":"Management Accounting"},{"text":"Advanced Excel basics"},{"text":"Data interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Database Management"},{"text":"Management Information Systems"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Data cleaning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"KPI design"},{"text":"Reporting automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced SQL"},{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"Python fundamentals"},{"text":"Business process analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","ite